完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-liang029-huili-zhengbiao-brother","subject_person_id":"tlu_uav_put","object_person_id":"m5k_t3s_umk_A","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其兄正德"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002","quote":"二年，侯景圍京邑，會理治嚴將入援，會北徐州刺史封山侯正表將應其兄正德，外託赴援，實謀襲廣陵，會理擊破之。方得進路，臺城陷，侯景遣前臨江太守董紹先以高祖手敕召會理，其僚佐咸勸距之。會理曰：「諸君心事，與我不同，天子年尊，受制賊虜，今有手敕召我入朝，臣子之心，豈得違背。且遠處江北，功業難成，不若身赴京都，圖之肘腋。吾計決矣。」遂席捲而行，以城輸紹先。至京，景以爲侍中、司空、兼中書令。雖在寇手，每思匡復，與西鄉侯勸等潛布腹心，要結壯士。時范陽祖皓斬紹先，據廣陵城起義，期以會理爲內應。皓敗，辭相連及，景矯詔免會理官，猶以白衣領尚書令。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002:m0032"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"北徐州刺史封山侯正表應其兄正德。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"正表","kind":"person","person_id":"tlu_uav_put","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-liang029-huili-zhengbiao-brother","subject_person_id":"tlu_uav_put","object_person_id":"m5k_t3s_umk_A","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其兄正德"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","para